# Repository EOL policy: text is stored and checked out as LF on every platform.
# Not applied retroactively (no mass renormalisation); see
# docs/data/dataset-freeze-v1-eol-erratum.md for the legacy Freeze V1 exceptions.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
